00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.000
automatically managed for you.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.830
And Cloud Functions
is designed to help

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:31.000
give your service the last mile
customization that you need

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.470
and we price it
that way as well.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:35.350
You only have to pay for
