00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:56.480
Can we switch to the laptop?

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:00.370
So, Cloud Functions integrates
with the Firebase command line

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:03.580
tools and it's is
easy to use as ever.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:07.350
All you need to do is
