00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:13.440
This is because our SDK and our
CLI work seamlessly together.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.320
We can load your code and
understand which Cloud

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.530
Functions are in your app.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.210
Once we finish
