00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:10.920
or rejected promise,
it'll be here as well as

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.670
with our integration in
Stackdriver Error Reporting.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.340
If you want to debug what's
happening in your function,

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.620
any print statements you
have inside your JavaScript

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.200
will automatically
