00:33:23.700 --> 00:33:25.870
So to recap, Cloud
Functions for Firebase

00:33:25.870 --> 00:33:27.339
is our programmatic glue.

00:33:27.339 --> 00:33:29.130
You've seen how it lets
you stitch together

00:33:29.130 --> 00:33:32.370
Firebase and Cloud products
to create your own serverless

00:33:32.370 --> 00:33:35.070
mobile back end.

00:33:35.070 --> 00:33:37.920
So before Cloud
Functions for Firebase,

00:33:37.920 --> 00:33:40.920
Firebase developers would have
to set up their own custom back

00:33:40.920 --> 00:33:42.900
end solutions to do
many of the things

00:33:42.900 --> 00:33:45.570
that Thomas went over today.

00:33:45.570 --> 00:33:48.390
So your mobile app would have
to connect your own API, not

00:33:48.390 --> 00:33:50.730
allowing you to take
advantage of all the things

00:33:50.730 --> 00:33:53.740
that the Firebase
SDKs have to offer.

00:33:53.740 --> 00:33:56.752
As a result, this would
increase complexity and time

00:33:56.752 --> 00:33:58.210
to implement the
core features that

00:33:58.210 --> 00:33:59.460
are already available for you.

00:34:02.650 --> 00:34:04.330
So with Cloud
Functions for Firebase,

00:34:04.330 --> 00:34:06.158
this is no longer the case.

00:34:06.158 --> 00:34:08.699
You get to tie together the best
parts of Firebase and Google

00:34:08.699 --> 00:34:11.908
Cloud to create a completely
serverless mobile back end

00:34:11.908 --> 00:34:13.449
and you still get
to use the Firebase

00:34:13.449 --> 00:34:15.280
SDKs in your mobile app.

00:34:15.280 --> 00:34:17.770
There's no need to manage
or set up your own servers.

00:34:17.770 --> 00:34:20.440
There's no need to worry
about scaling up or down.

00:34:20.440 --> 00:34:22.420
There's also no need to
pay for the resources

00:34:22.420 --> 00:34:23.900
that you aren't utilizing.

00:34:26.850 --> 00:34:29.880
So we've seen a couple examples
of how you can stitch together

00:34:29.880 --> 00:34:32.670
Firebase and Cloud products to
easily create powerful Cloud

00:34:32.670 --> 00:34:33.408
Functions.

00:34:33.408 --> 00:34:35.699
You've seen how to reengage
customers through analytics

00:34:35.699 --> 00:34:38.790
using conversion events,
